<section class="section-anchor" id="care">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">★ Inherited wealth · Shared knowledge</div>
  <div class="section-heading">Care for your home</div>
  <div class="section-sub">The way we built Philly is a building tradition we inherited. Old homes are resilient and want maintenance — <em>lime plaster, brick, slate, single-pane glass.</em> Newer homes have different needs. What works on your block probably works on mine.</div>
  <div class="gilt-rule"></div>

